{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T14:13:30.488Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/community-list **Type:** Directory":"## routing/filter/community-list \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/filter-wizard **Type:** Command":"## routing/filter/filter-wizard \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/num-list **Type:** Directory":"## routing/filter/num-list \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/rule **Type:** Directory":"## routing/filter/rule\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/select-rule **Type:** Directory":"## routing/filter/select-rule \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/sync **Type:** Command":"## routing/filter/sync \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/filter/test-as-path-regexp **Type:** Command":"## routing/filter/test-as-path-regexp \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/gmp **Type:** Directory":"## routing/gmp \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/id **Type:** Directory":"## routing/id \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/igmp-proxy **Type:** Settings Directory":"## routing/igmp-proxy \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/igmp-proxy/interface **Type:** Directory":"## routing/igmp-proxy/interface \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/igmp-proxy/mfc **Type:** Directory":"## routing/igmp-proxy/mfc \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/isis/interface-template **Type:** Directory":"## routing/isis/interface-template \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000Configure what interfaces will participate as IGMP proxy interfaces on the router. If an interface is not configured as an IGMP proxy interface, then all IGMP traffic received on it will be ignored.":"配置哪些接口将作为路由器上的 IGMP 代理接口参与。如果某个接口未配置为 IGMP 代理接口，则该接口上收到的所有 IGMP 流量都会被忽略。","docs-7.24\u0000For each VRF table, RouterOS adds a dynamic ID instance that elects the Router ID from one of the IP addresses in that VRF:":"对于每个 VRF 表，RouterOS 会添加一个动态 ID 实例，从该 VRF 中的某个 IP 地址选举 Router ID：","docs-7.24\u0000Global Router ID election configuration. The Router ID can be configured explicitly or elected from one of the router's IP addresses.":"全局 Router ID 选举配置。Router ID 可以显式配置，也可以从路由器的某个 IP 地址中选举。","docs-7.24\u0000It is possible to get detailed status information for each interface using the `print status` command.":"可以使用 `print status` 命令获取每个接口的详细状态信息。","docs-7.24\u0000Multicast forwarding cache(MFC) status.":"组播转发缓存（MFC）状态。","docs-7.24\u0000RouterOS supports static multicast forwarding rules for IGMP proxy. If a static rule is added, all dynamic rules for that group will be ignored. These rules will take effect only if IGMP-proxy interfaces are configured(upstream and downstream interfaces should be set) otherwise these rules won't be active.":"RouterOS 支持 IGMP proxy 的静态组播转发规则。如果添加静态规则，该组的所有动态规则都将被忽略。这些规则仅在配置了 IGMP-proxy 接口后生效（应设置 upstream 和 downstream 接口），否则这些规则不会处于活动状态。"}}
